# AgentSwarm on Cursor

`SWARM_ROOT` is the absolute path of a pinned agent-swarm checkout. Swarm tools are:

`python3 "$SWARM_ROOT/scripts/<tool>.py" --root <this repo> --json`

`<this repo>` is the git toplevel of the repository you are editing. If `SWARM_ROOT` is unset, repo-local `scripts/` are swarm tools only inside the agent-swarm checkout itself (it contains `swarm/taskstore.py` and `scripts/orch_plan.py`). In any other repo, including one that already has a `scripts/` directory, stop and report `BLOCKED` with `needs` `SWARM_ROOT`. Do not run that repo's `scripts/` as swarm tools.

Cursor cloud sessions are advisory. No signing key is present (`SWARM_ED25519_KEY` and `SWARM_REQUIRE_KEY` are unset). Gate scripts record nothing. Nothing this session produces counts as APPROVED. The merge gate is Greptile, run by Desk Quality.

Nesting stops at two levels. The parent session may spawn `a01-orchestrator`. A01 may spawn the other fourteen slugs with the Task tool (`subagent_type` is the slug). Those specialists must not spawn further subagents.

Do not start an unattended headless runner. Dispatch by spawning the Cursor subagents above.
